	(text "References in the 400 series. R402 R_L1, R405 R_L2, R407 R_INJ, R408/R409 R_T1/R_T2, R410..R412 R_B5/R_B20/R_B100, R413 R_S, R416 R_OUT, U401 op-amp (A = bias, B = signal), U402 74HC4066, U403 comparator, U404 DAC, D401 = D1 (TVS)."
